[{"id":"2075","date":"2026-10-31T18:16:08+00:00","text":"ETF investors are pulling out of $ETH. US spot ETH ETFs have now seen 23 straight sessions of outflows, the longest streak since the funds launched. This signals weak demand from traditional investors who bought heavily in August and September.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/UHOT7mQpkz30148YBo-y9d3kLFUCHVMIPn87xbPmPdoyOJHXf6WKaouqrPE08RLgmjFCvAE4oGH-f5Arx9dIFSoqhzCnRIHFO2WVUgjvMGTGif7TZ-cj72QFFXzOQxRLeFy4jgVgwgiCKftyfaogeKHTqO3t1FVL5A5mdNhQBHd4HJe2gsDViNqih9PgaFguTt6OQrRccbMwIlLojAOVlFYmVQ8wtZ1fJZCCJ52r7kOu9aTmyH3uZ235Vjxswuc9ugSvsM-OFzvdqWJmoVjgM0bEUqDQLY6Kg9-k8fV_QThQmhvw7mLF1uwYE429M95uEe5mcxmAfvRR65s-OgzF5w.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2074","date":"2026-10-30T19:01:22+00:00","text":"Yesterday’s Binance hack is the largest in crypto history. Over $6 billion was affected, more than the next 9 largest hacks combined. The previous largest, Bybit in February 2025, was $1.5 billion. 3 out of the 10 largest have now happened since 2025, all at exchanges.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Lj4VEl-nsr53ylAnHjrZ2E8ZaoGhWxZh2HPVhx-yszbzYIaZXH3eWyZbv5cWCvW-8GpeMq5w4pw0xgQ_LwC1mZozw0mxnUvoTsOZAlfwm9a6RYP8BFCCfsKTc5pn82fhtWw19LaHrFPaXE-nWVfxxcWBiMcuR2AMe_Dki2S5djHAvwEW_n9uPD3GJ-RyQ9bKWOG75yTltdydqWYasWE_-Q9wSfTKWqlPh-Ia6qmOeO7NRMiC8ICSaRFlk--rgtwhAQUwl_Ice32tx9Rp-9haYYcFuaoEB6EJwBryX6VD8GnnF9UMIgptHKHa0NcZuDJLKykFVZ63LowQPYxyWQITpg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"2073","date":"2026-10-30T18:02:23+00:00","text":"$BTC is retesting the True Market Mean. It could pull back all the way to the short-term holder cost basis at $75.8k and still be a good setup for continuation. Retests like this are normal in an uptrend. The last one, in mid-September, came days before the high of the move.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/AVLDodTLHwynL_5Fo-jKWnhm62AQyZiUZAM4kUpUzgjRGtzUTr4t9cxzScX3sfzSuuWBdIsga38_lZZkKCByvcnZYwPBT7qbjPQYgkj7iE2TRBM96F6EIrDaBj_6BZIepbQ0CXLjs2xGddZCRrsYI0W7YBrFUiV2CH2J4t9uw